; Portable ANSI rendition interpreter experiment, not a production callback.
; HL -> C little-endian SGR parameter words (0..16). C=0 means SGR 0.
; A=0 success, HL -> nine-byte canonical rendition; A=255 malformed extended
; color/count, previous rendition unchanged. Unknown ordinary SGRs are ignored.
; Record: flags (bold,faint,italic,underline,blink,reverse,conceal,strike),
; foreground kind (0 default/1 indexed/2 RGB), three color bytes,
; background kind and three bytes. No escape strings or hardware addresses.
        ASEG
        ORG 08000H
        INCLUDE rendition.inc
